---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { cases } from '../lib/site';
import discovery from '../../content/discovery.json';
const introduction = discovery.pages.find(p => p.id === 'home')!;
---
<SiteLayout>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-frame" aria-hidden="true"></span> WRITE HTML. RENDER VIDEO.</p><h1>让你的想法，<br />成为<span>下一帧。</span></h1><p class="hero-description">用一句中文开启创作，让 AI 帮你制作、修改与导出视频。<br class="desktop-break" />从认识 HyperFrames，到完成第一个可编辑的作品。</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button primary" href="/start/studio/">开始制作第一个视频</a><a class="button secondary" href="/showcase/">先看看能做什么</a></div><p class="hero-footnote">开源框架 · 多种创作入口 · 中文学习与实践</p></div>
    <div class="hero-workbench" aria-label="本站产品介绍案例的真实渲染画面">
      <div class="workbench-top"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><span>first-video / index.html</span><span class="file-tag">HTML → MP4</span></div>
      <a class="hero-film" href="/showcase/product-intro/"><img src="/media/product-intro.jpg" width="960" height="540" alt="实际渲染案例：从想法到成片，展示可编辑的产品介绍" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="film-label"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> 看 8 秒实际成片</span></a>
      <div class="timeline" aria-hidden="true"><div class="timeline-ruler"><span>00:00</span><span>00:02</span><span>00:04</span><span>00:06</span><span>00:08</span></div><div class="timeline-track"><span>标题与界面</span><span>重点呈现</span><span>收尾</span></div><div class="playhead"></div></div>
      <div class="prompt-note"><span class="prompt-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span>“把标题再大一点，让重点停留久一些。”</span><span class="prompt-status">继续编辑</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="proof-strip wrap"><span>一句需求</span><b aria-hidden="true">/</b><span>可编辑项目</span><b aria-hidden="true">/</b><span>逐帧预览</span><b aria-hidden="true">/</b><span>导出视频</span><a href="/overview/what-is-hyperframes/">认识它的工作方式</a></div>
  <section class="wrap section cases-section" aria-labelledby="cases-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MADE WITH HYPERFRAMES</p><h2 id="cases-heading">先看作品，再选你的方向。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/showcase/">查看全部案例</a></div><div class="showcase-grid">{cases.map((item, i) => <a class={`showcase-card ${i === 0 ? 'featured' : ''}`} href={`/showcase/${item.id}/`}><div class="poster"><img src={`/media/${item.id}.jpg`} alt={`${item.category}实际渲染画面`} width="960" height="540" loading="lazy" /><span class="poster-play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><span class="duration">{item.duration}</span></div><div class="case-caption"><p class="eyebrow">{item.eyebrow}</p><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p></div></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="paths-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR WAY IN</p><h2>选一条适合你的起点。</h2></div><p>同一种项目，三种进入方式。</p></div><div class="paths"><article><span class="path-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▣</span><p class="path-type">想直接开始创作</p><h3>使用 Studio</h3><p>在桌面应用里描述需求，边预览边调整。适合希望专注内容的创作者。</p><a class="button primary" href="/start/studio/">Studio 入门</a></article><article><span class="path-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p class="path-type">已经在使用 AI 编程工具</p><h3>交给你的 Agent</h3><p>让 Codex、Claude Code 或 Cursor 读取 Skills，把想法写成视频项目。</p><a class="button secondary" href="/start/codex/">使用 Codex 开始</a></article><article><span class="path-symbol code-symbol" aria-hidden="true">&gt;_</span><p class="path-type">希望掌握完整工作流</p><h3>从命令行开始</h3><p>创建、检查、预览与渲染，逐步接入你自己的开发和自动化流程。</p><a class="button secondary" href="/start/cli/">CLI 快速开始</a></article></div><a class="path-compare" href="/overview/choose-your-path/">还不确定？比较使用方式与前置条件</a></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section capability-section"><div class="capability-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A PROJECT YOU CAN KEEP EDITING</p><h2>生成之后，<br />创作才刚开始。</h2><p>项目保留 HTML、样式、媒体与动画。修改字幕、调整节奏、替换素材，让每一次反馈都落到具体画面。</p><a class="text-link" href="/features/editing/">探索产品能力</a></div><div class="capability-list">{[{n:'文字与字幕',p:'中文排版、逐句呈现、强调关键词。',url:'captions'},{n:'动画与视觉',p:'从信息动效，到场景转场与镜头运动。',url:'motion'},{n:'图片、视频与声音',p:'组织已有素材，理解生成服务的使用条件。',url:'media'},{n:'预览、渲染与分享',p:'检查画面与时间轴，再输出可以交付的视频。',url:'render-share'}].map((x,i)=><a href={`/features/${x.url}/`}><span class="list-number">0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{x.n}</h3><p>{x.p}</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="wrap update-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">LEARN IN CHINESE. STAY IN SYNC.</p><h2>中文经验，与官方一起更新。</h2><p>每篇指南保留来源与核对日期。通过开源协作，让教程、案例和使用经验持续完善。</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button secondary" href="/updates/">阅读更新</a><a class="text-link" href="/community/contributing/">一起完善中文指南</a></div></div><div class="update-note"><span class="note-tag">首版内容</span><h3>从三个入口，理解完整工作流</h3><p>认识 Studio、Agent 与 CLI，找到适合自己的第一步。</p><a href="/updates/first-edition/">阅读首篇解读</a><hr /><a href="/guides/chinese-typography/">中文字体与字幕实践</a><a href="/guides/troubleshooting/">遇到问题，从这里排查</a></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section home-definition answer-summary" aria-label="阅读摘要"><h2>{introduction.question}</h2><p>{introduction.answer}</p><a href="/overview/what-is-hyperframes/">了解原理与官方来源</a></section>
</SiteLayout>
